# NASA Li-ion Battery Dataset Analysis

This notebook replicates the functionality from the [NASA Battery project](https://github.com/natskiu/Nasa-Battery) by Venus Lee and Jesse Wang.

## Project Overview

This notebook demonstrates two main machine learning tasks:

1. **Predicting remaining capacity (SoH) of Li-ion batteries** using traditional ML models
2. **Predicting future discharge curves** using LSTM networks

The dataset consists of Li-ion batteries with rated capacity of 2Ah, repeatedly charged to 4V and discharged at ambient temperature, with constant discharge current of 2A.